{"id":1362,"name":"Juushin Enbu: Hero Tales","slug":"juushin_enbu_hero_tales","synopsis":"For citizens of the Ken Empire, justice is a myth. Lord Keiro, the deranged Shogun of the Imperial Army, blazes a trail of terror across the countryside in search of the sacred sword that will make him a god. Standing in his way is Taito, an omnipotent star reborn in human form - a young hero who vows to use his celestial strength to avenge those slaughtered by the villainous Shogun.\n\nTaito's mystical powers steer him toward a violent showdown with Keiro, and if used recklessly, his newfound abilities could shred the very fabric of his being. To master the art of control and become a heroic martial artist, Taito must seek the guidance of others like him: the seven star-born warriors with the strength to shatter a corrupt empire.\n\n(Source: RightStuff)","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2007,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:00","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 03:45:13","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":2772},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":2772},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":2530},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":5314},{"site":"ANN","externalId":8281},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":1590},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":2715,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/OjajS92SZ40Z8hqe4E4ApZBOEGuogbzi54X5kwEV.jpg"},{"id":2716,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/ouMH4Wc0OBdb6puEPCYn9Qz7MT8A5GFqy6Vn8QrI.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":235,"name":"Studio Flag","slug":"studio_flag"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":2627,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":2627,"title":"WINTERLONG","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":2952,"version":1,"episodes":"1-18, 26","nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":1700,"basename":"JuushinEnbu-OP1.webm","filename":"JuushinEnbu-OP1","link":"https://v.animethemes.moe/JuushinEnbu-OP1.webm","mimetype":"video/webm